#DescriptionBegin
#Defines theorem environments and the proof environment using the extended
#AMS machinery. Both numbered and unnumbered types are provided. By default,
#the theorems are numbered consecutively throughout the document. This can be
#changed by loading the 'Theorems (Numbered by Section) Plus' module.
#DescriptionEnd
#Excludes: theorems-std | theorems-ams | theorems-starred | theorems-bytype | theorems-ams-bytype | theorems-ams-chap-bytype | theorems-ams-extended-chap-bytype | theorems-ams-new | theorems-ams-extended-new | theorems-sec-new | theorems-starred-new | theorem-starred-plus


